    "Description": "The gcc-toolset-16-gcc13 package contains the GNU Compiler Collection version 16.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* gcc-toolset-15-gcc: gcc: gcc-toolset-16: gcc: Denial of Service via use-after-free in binary heap erase_if (CVE-2026-102010)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
